IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. BRANCHFILE.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION. INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION. FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT F ASSIGN TO 'SYNTHETIC' ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS ST.
DATA DIVISION. FILE SECTION. FD F. 01 REC PIC X(3).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 01 ST PIC XX. 01 N PIC 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
PERFORM UNTIL ST = '10'
 READ F AT END DISPLAY 'EOF' NOT AT END ADD 1 TO N END-READ
 IF ST = '00' DISPLAY REC ELSE DISPLAY ST END-IF
END-PERFORM
DISPLAY N GOBACK.
